# Single point of control for the frozen-snapshot build chain (01/03/04/05).
# Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE lines; the Python steps parse the same file.
#
# CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_YEAR drives the published population column
# (population_<year>), the snapshot data_year, and the PMTiles filenames
# (crimerisk_block_groups_<year>.pmtiles, crimerisk_tracts_<year>.pmtiles).
# CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_SRC is the repo-relative published block-group parquet the
# snapshot is frozen from. CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_TRACT_SRC is the tract parquet the
# murder/rape layers are frozen from (same run as SRC): those two offenses are
# published at census-tract support, so the block-group parquet carries NULL for
# their per-offense index/rate and the tract parquet carries them. CRIMERISK_
# SNAPSHOT_OUT is the repo-relative directory the published snapshot artifacts
# (both .pmtiles archives and snapshot.json) are written to; frontend/public is
# the live site.
#
CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_YEAR=2025
CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_SRC=state/candidates/v53-2025/crimerisk_block_group_2025_ags_core.parquet
CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_TRACT_SRC=state/candidates/v53-2025/crimerisk_tract_2025_ags_core.parquet
CRIMERISK_SNAPSHOT_OUT=frontend/public
